{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6001_p", "source_sha256": "4b63b05ace1c477895fa6df1a0a60307899ca45bfebbf6aec9fc6ee496f1513f", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の企画で、美奈子が\n飲食店の肉食フェアをPRすることになった……）", "zh": "（在写真杂志《アイグラ！！》的企划中，美奈子要为餐饮店的肉食节进行宣传……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6002_019min", "source_sha256": "5a1af9ff2f2d7b7a06bec777c0f1075b2d89c877ba52450b7e514f9ebd8b832a", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん！\nPR用のポスターの撮影、どうでしたか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n用于宣传的海报拍摄得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6003_p", "source_sha256": "e8643795796b1a6d6bf9c6f79cdb62fbd03e4cf389b36d1e122126193cb76f9b", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだったぞ！　美奈子が料理を持つと、\n美味しそうに見えて……お腹が空いてきたよ。", "zh": "啊，特别顺利！美奈子一拿起料理，看起来就特别美味……都让我饿起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6004_019min", "source_sha256": "9738cfb133f40bbe4f9068e72478f5a9df893dbd947183339e2021caedb8a03b", "ja": "よかった♪　ポスターを見て、空腹になったら\n大成功です。だって、空腹は最高の調味料ですからね。", "zh": "太好了♪　看了海报会觉得肚子饿，\n就算是大成功了。毕竟饥饿是最好的调味料嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6005_p", "source_sha256": "dca7147bea6d3873d71faceab28b439d1af6e8bf7adfd6d428cbfd7fe19fb67b", "ja": "はは、そうだな。撮影は無事終わったし、\nあとは……美奈子考案のコラボメニューだけだな。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。拍摄顺利结束了，接下来……就只剩下美奈子设计的联名菜单了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6006_019min", "source_sha256": "1197828da69e93d8fb098b964521d837d91c2c0133b37e9ac1c2619c49ba7d59", "ja": "はい、任せてください！　って言いたいんですけど、\nなかなか決まらなくて……。", "zh": "是的，请交给我吧！虽然我是想这么说的，可一直都拿不定主意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6007_019min", "source_sha256": "74dceb7dc36e7f7759707d2db61ecebcff4cb5d47d059206a7616d0a0b4c3650", "ja": "世の中にはお肉料理が、いーっぱいあるんです！\nだから何か一品って言われると難しくて……。", "zh": "世上有好多好多肉类料理呢！\n所以要我选出一道菜，还真有点难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6008_019min", "source_sha256": "b7e4fb2b03307aeb1bb1d367cc6f56a50dbffb423d2f20817760d550ec638584", "ja": "{$P$}さんなら、どんなメニューが\nいいと思いますか？　参考に聞かせてください！", "zh": "如果是{$P$}先生，您觉得什么菜比较好呢？请告诉我，给我参考一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6009", "source_sha256": "773f6e8debf0aba912a4de741f8fc88ff55c5666114068cd3f34325ac8327b40", "ja": "ビッグマウンテン丼", "zh": "大份山盖饭", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6010", "source_sha256": "bf7d2344b6d9b789e2b6801d38e015ebdd506c9860dffc64fd414d75af67f7bd", "ja": "中華風ハンバーグ", "zh": "中华风汉堡排", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6011", "source_sha256": "49aaacc5d5f6350d71c3c4a4a11224c79138da8dd46c8bf84031e699f7bd6c07", "ja": "肉の懐石料理", "zh": "肉类怀石料理", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6100_p", "source_sha256": "750b3736e7914cabc9783d3f39c9f68b7f5a2e7ddb384fc39bbb0a05904e1d89", "ja": "お肉を山のように積み上げた\nボリューム満点の丼なんてどうだ？", "zh": "把肉堆得像山一样高的超大分量盖饭怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6101_019min", "source_sha256": "a2d2255033700b35f3b17d88b5a835bbae00f2b4ed701a5767db1c7561baced7", "ja": "わっほーい！　お腹いっぱいになりそうでいいですね！\n山盛りの肉料理……うん、作りがいもありそうです！", "zh": "哇呼——！看起来能吃得很饱，真不错呢！\n堆得满满的肉料理……嗯，感觉也很值得做呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6102_019min", "source_sha256": "4c4f04c58bf6036df5ffc20e5d14fc9719606fa914daac79ca1bdfd0088d3f95", "ja": "提案する前に、試しに作ってみようかな？　その時は\n{$P$}さん、味見お願いしますね♪", "zh": "要不要在提议之前先试着做做看？到时候就拜托{$P$}先生帮忙尝尝味道啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6200_p", "source_sha256": "b989185da6a0d88a5bc710a828c6d4bd2bf71b5367d33ab6d5346faf76f8c7e3", "ja": "ハンバーグは、大人から子どもまで大好きだろう？\nそれを中華風にアレンジしてみるのはどうかな？", "zh": "大人和孩子都喜欢汉堡肉饼吧？  \n把它改成中式风味怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6201_019min", "source_sha256": "c78cc1d4c63d35f1f3630096e801bc174a59412affa7cc34b73f3f5093568a0a", "ja": "うんうん、いいと思います！　香辛料を使ったり、\nソースをあんかけにしたり、いろいろできそうですね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，我觉得很好！可以使用香辛料，\n或者把酱汁换成芡汁，感觉能做出很多花样呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6202_019min", "source_sha256": "f519928a64d02f63788478f6c34c1c1a78341353bab5c6665e5a0d462390d75f", "ja": "うう～……メニューがたくさん浮かんできました！\n肉食フェア、めいっぱい盛り上げちゃいますね♪", "zh": "唔唔～……脑子里浮现出好多菜品！\n肉食博览会，我一定会全力炒热气氛的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6300_p", "source_sha256": "6003ec2d6ec29057678f9c9c3320b9d6d7d1c2484e90ac08a16467b2b57468ab", "ja": "高級なお肉を使った懐石料理はどうだ？\n特別感があって、美味しそうだと思うんだ。", "zh": "用高级肉类做的怀石料理怎么样？\n既特别又让人觉得一定很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6301_019min", "source_sha256": "840dcbbd5817dd68e2ea0983f790da690b8ee53708a35a5c15ce64a154eab884", "ja": "なるほど～、その発想はありませんでした……！\nたしかに、おいしいお肉は食べられますけど……。", "zh": "原来如此～我还真没想到这一点……！\n确实能吃到美味的肉，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_6302_019min", "source_sha256": "17e845f3cd5cb28094d60fa0cb92155b81ff63a83a8892062f04f2f46504c982", "ja": "私らしいかと言われると……うーん……。\nもっとお肉を食べられる方が……いや、でも……。", "zh": "如果要说这像不像我……嗯……要是能吃更多肉的话……不对，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
